items/cor-cofinality-of-a-cardinal-power.md:51:**Given:** The Axiom of Choice and an infinite cardinal $\kappa$.
items/cor-cofinality-of-a-cardinal-power.md:55:[L2] For a constant family, $\prod_{i \in I}\kappa = \kappa^{\lvert I\rvert}$; and $\sum_{i \in I}\kappa_i = \lvert \bigcup_{i \in I}(\{i\} \times \kappa_i)\rvert$ ([[def-infinite-cardinal-sum-and-product]]).
